   "definition_quote": "On each round $t \\in [T]$, each expert $j \\in [N]$ selects an advice $e_t(j) \\in [K]$ which is presented to the learner. Then, the learner pulls an arm $I_t \\in [K]$ and the adversary simultaneously assigns a loss $\\ell_t(r) \\in \\{0,1\\}$ for each arm $r \\in [K]$. The learner observes only the loss it suffers... Note that the adversary is \\emph{adaptive}"
